      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_TOUCH",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "휴우… 겨우 통과했네요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふぅ…なんとか通過できましたね。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "呼…總算通過了。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_1.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 3,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "드디어 지난 날들이 결실을 맺었어요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "これまでの努力が、ついに実を結びました！",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "我這段期間的努力終於有了成果！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_2.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "고생 많았어, 다나.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "お疲れ様、ダーナ。",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_TWN": "辛苦了，達娜。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아하하! 고생은 단장님이 많이 하셨죠.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あはは！団長こそ、お疲れ様でした。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "啊哈哈！團長才更辛苦吧。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_3.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "시골에서 막 올라와서 아무것도 몰랐던 저를 여기까지 이끌어 주셔서 감사해요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "田舎から出てきたばかりで、何も知らなかったわたしのことを…ここまで導いてくださって、ありがとうございました。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "謝謝您帶著一個從鄉下來、什麼都不懂的我到這裡。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_4.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…어라?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…あれ？",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "…咦？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_5.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "단장님, 방금 웃으신 거 맞죠? 방금처럼 환한 표정은 처음 봐요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長、いま笑いましたよね？こんなに明るい笑顔は、初めてです！",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "團長，您剛才笑了對吧？我好像從來沒有見過如此燦爛的表情！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_6.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "한 번만! 딱 한 번만 더 웃어 주시면 안돼요? 네?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もう一度！もう一度だけ、笑ってくれませんか？ね？",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "再一次！就再笑一下好嗎？好嗎？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_7.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "연락관이 기다리고 있어",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "連絡官が待ってるよ。",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_TWN": "聯絡官在等著。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아~ 아쉬운데요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うぅ～、残念です…",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "啊～好可惜…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_8.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_TOUCH",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "돌아가면 한 번 더 보여 주시기예요? 아셨죠?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "帰ったらもう一度見せてくださいね？分かりましたか？",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "回去後再給我看一次好嗎？約好囉？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_10_DRUID_9.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나는 잠시 그녀의 환한 얼굴을 바라보았다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は、しばらく彼女の眩しい笑顔を見つめていた。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "我望著她燦爛的表情。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "수많은 시련과 상처를 딛고 마침내 <color=#F7BE45>[여정]</color>의 끝에 도달한 자.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "幾多の試練と痛みを克服し、ついに<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>の終わりに到達した者。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "經歷無數試煉和傷痛，終於抵達了<color=#F7BE45>「旅行」</color>的終點。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그녀의 앞에는 더욱 많은 고난과 어려움이 기다리고 있을 것이다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女には、更なる苦悩と困難が待ち受けているはずだ。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "在她面前還有更多苦難和困境在等著她。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 나는 믿는다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "しかし、私は信じよう。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "但我相信…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그녀는 분명 나를 뛰어넘을…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女ならきっと、私を超える…",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "她一定能超越我…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "최고의 <color=#F7BE45>[구원자]</color>가 될 것이라는 걸.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "最高の<color=#F7BE45>「救援者」</color>になれるということを。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "成為最出色的<color=#F7BE45>「救援者」</color>。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
