      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이걸로 구원자님은 <color=#F7BE45>[여정]</color> 최종 시험을 통과하셨습니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "これにて救援者様は<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>の最終試験を通過されました。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "您已經通過了<color=#F7BE45>旅行</color>的最終考試。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_S_NOA_LISA",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그럼 이제 돌아갈까요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "では、戻りましょうか？",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "那麼現在就回去吧？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
